# Environment Configuration

Environment variables are loaded from the repository root `.env` file when available.

```dotenv
APP_NAME=LandSense
APP_ENV=development
DEMO_MODE=true

POSTGRES_DB=landslide
POSTGRES_USER=landslide
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=landslide
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_PORT=5432

REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE=maptiler://...

OPENMETEO_BASE_URL=https://api.open-meteo.com/v1
OPENMETEO_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=5
OPENMETEO_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=8
COPERNICUS_CLIENT_ID=
COPERNICUS_CLIENT_SECRET=
NASA_EARTHDATA_TOKEN=

FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=
FIREBASE_WEB_API_KEY=
FIREBASE_SENDER_ID=

JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-production
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60

MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI=http://localhost:5000
MLFLOW_EXPERIMENT_NAME=landslide-risk

LOG_LEVEL=INFO
```
